CM_ SG_ 2566662398 MapBasedVSLmt "The vehicle speed limit provided by digital map data.
Parameter Specific Indicator: A value of FB00h indicates there is not a speed limit provided by the map for the current location.
Note:  See SPN 21793 (Traffic Sign Speed Limit) for road sign ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566662398 CurRoadwayVSLmt "The vehicle speed limit in effect will be provided in Current Roadway Vehicle Speed Limit when the Current Roadway Vehicle Speed Limit Mode is 010b (Active).  This parameter may be used for operator displays if Current Roadway Vehicle Speed Limit ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566662398 SelectedRoadwayVSLmt "The value in this parameter defines a pending change in Current Roadway Vehicle Speed Limit when Current Roadway Vehicle Speed Limit Mode is 010b (Active) or 000b (Disabled).  This parameter may be used for operator displays of an upcoming vehicle ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566662398 CurRoadwayVSLmtMode "This signal indicates if current roadway vehicle speed is actively applied.
0000b = Disabled
0001b = Inactive
0010b = Active
0011b = Operator Override
0100b = Reserved
0101b = Reserved
0110b = Reserved
0111b = Reserved
1000b = Reserved
 ...";
