0011b = Reserved
0100b = Reserved
0101b = Reserved
0110b = Reserved
0111b = Reserved
1000b = ...";
CM_ SG_ 2365207550 Synch "Command for an indicator lamp to synchronize with other indicator lamps on the network and flash the same pattern.

00b = Not Requested
01b = Requested
10b = Reserved
11b = Not Available";
