CM_ SG_ 2365203966 Cur "The current in or out of the High Voltage Energy Storage System (or Pack 1 in systems with only one pack). This parameter should be synchronized with SPN 22352 (HVESS Voltage Level (Extended Range)) such that a realized power value can be ...";
CM_ SG_ 2365203966 Lvl "The voltage level of the High Voltage Energy Storage System (or Pack 1 in systems with only one pack). This parameter should be synchronized with SPN 22351 (HVESS Current (Extended Range)) such that a realized power value can be calculated. If the ...";
