CM_ SG_ 2365203710 HVBusNegPreChargeRelaySt "Position of the high-voltage bus contactor negative pre-charge relay. When this relay is closed, the High Voltage Energy Storage System (or Pack 1 in systems with only one pack) is bringing the high-voltage bus up to its operating level when the ...";
CM_ SG_ 2365203710 HVBusPosPreChargeRelaySt "Position of the high-voltage bus contactor positive pre-charge relay. When this relay is closed, the High Voltage Energy Storage System (or Pack 1 in systems with only one pack) is bringing the high-voltage bus up to its operating level when the ...";
CM_ SG_ 2365203710 PwrHoldRelaySt "Status of the relay for keep alive power in the HVESS independent of the enable input to the HVESS.  For example, this could allow continued device operation after the keyswitch has turned off.

