CM_ SG_ 2365203710 ExposureInd "This signal indicates the condition and state of the HVESS high voltage exposure detection system (e.g. High Voltage Interlock Loop [HVIL], welded contactor etc.,). The high voltage exposure detection system is used to detect situations on a vehicle ...";
CM_ SG_ 2365203710 EstChargeTimeRem "The HVESS charge time remaining with the current battery state of charge and the average charging of the HVESS.";
CM_ SG_ 2365203710 EstDisTimeRem "The HVESS discharge time remaining with the current battery state of charge and the average usage of the HVESS.";
CM_ SG_ 2365203710 InCoolantPress "Gage pressure of coolant entering as it enters the High Voltage Energy Storage System.";
CM_ BO_ 2566530046 "Motor/Generator Location (obsolete, use PGN 64018)
