CM_ SG_ 2566530046 VehSegment "Conveys the vehicle segment where the given axle is located. The definition of the trailer (i.e. Trailer 1, Trailer 2,3,4,5) follows the ISO11992-2 specification (Section 6.3 Address Assignment) for the order of the trailer assigment.
0000b = ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566530046 Rotation "Direction of Motor/Generator (MG) rotation with respect to forward gear and forward vehicle direction. Positive and negative speeds directly correlate with the signs of the speed used to control, or as reported from, a Motor/Generator, e.g. MG1IC ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566530046 Id "Identifies the Motor/Generator instance assigned to a given axle and location. The instance number correlates to the Motor/Generator (MG) messages being used, e.g. MG1IC, MG2IC, MG3IC, MG4IC, MG5IC, MG6IC, etc.
