0001b = ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566530046 SPN22255 "For the given SPN 22628 (Axle Instance), this is the location of a given Motor/Generator (MG) instance on that axle.
0000b = Not Driven
0001b = Left Side - MG located on the left side of the axle when facing forward in the driver’s seat. Includes ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566530046 AxleInstance "Number of the axle instances being reported on from this controller application for this vehicle segment. Axle 1 is at the front of the vehicle segment and the count will increase towards the rear. If the parameter is No Axle this indicates that the ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566530046 NumOfAxleInstancesBeingReported "The number of axles being reported on by this controller.";
