01b = Close Contactor; Connect to high-voltage bus
10b = Reserved
11b = Don't care / Take no action";
CM_ SG_ 2365201918 HVBusInterface1ConnectCmd "Command to connect the main high-voltage bus to this high-voltage bus interface instance.  

