CM_ BO_ 2432310526 "Electronic Engine Controller 25
Engine related parameters";
CM_ SG_ 2432310526 OpSt "Used to identify the status of engine crankcase pressure control Actuator 2.
0000b = Normal
0001b = Alarm (fully operational but needs service)
0010b = Alarm High Severity (functional but transient performance may be reduced)
0011b = Derate ...";
CM_ SG_ 2432310526 TempSt "Used to identify the status of the crankcase pressure control actuator 2 drive circuitry temperature.  Temperature excursions may affect the torque output.
000b = High Most severe
001b = High Least severe
010b = In Range
011b = Low Least severe
 ...";
CM_ SG_ 2432310526 PreliminaryFMI "Used to identify the applicable J1939-73 FMI detected in the crankcase pressure control actuator 2 by the manufacturers software. When there is multiple failures, the most severe is transmitted.
A value of 31 is sent to indicate that no failure has ...";
CM_ SG_ 2432310526 DesPos "The requested position of the Engine Crankcase Pressure Control Actuator 2 by the engine ECU, where 0% represents bypass fully closed and 100% represents bypass fully open. This is the position that the device is attempting to achieve.";
CM_ SG_ 2432310526 Pos "Measures the position of the engine crankcase pressure control actuator 2, where 0% represents actuator is fully closed and 100% represents actuator is fully open.";
CM_ SG_ 2432310526 Temp "Temperature of the engine crankcase pressure control actuator 2 drive circuitry.";
