Contains data pertaining specifically to tracked vehicles, such as a tank or bulldozer.";
CM_ SG_ 2364761342 RightTransOutShaftDirSpd "Rotational speed of the right-side output shaft. The right side of the vehicle is to the operator's right during normal forward operation. Positive output shaft rotation occurs when the right side of the vehicle moves forward.";
CM_ SG_ 2364761342 LeftTransOutShaftDirSpd "Rotational speed of the left-side output shaft. The left side of the vehicle is to the operator's left during normal forward operation. Positive output shaft rotation occurs when the left side of the vehicle moves forward.";
