0000b = Protocol yet to be determined
0001b = Control Pilot PWM (e.g. as used by single phase AC systems)
0010b = LIN Bus (e.g. as used by 3-phase systems supporting J3068)
0011b = PLC comms ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566575870 ConnType "Indicates the type of the connected EVSE.
If the CA only supports one type of EVSE this SP may be statically set to the appropriate value.  For systems that support multiple concurrently active connections this SP must be used instead of SPN 13154 ...";
