011b = Reserved
100b = Reserved
101b = No locking mechanism is available on this vehicle
110b = Error
111b = Not ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566575870 ManualOvrd "Indicates the state of a manual override switch on the vehicle, if present. The switch may be used to disable charging and unlock the the connector.

00b = Manual override not active
01b = Manual override active
10b = Error
11b = Not available";
