CM_ SG_ 2566570238 TotalChargeGenerated "Indicates the total lifetime charge generated by this Motor/Generator.  For example, this would include the charge created during regerative braking in a propulsion motor.";
CM_ SG_ 2566570238 TotalChargeConsumed "Indicates the total lifetime charge consumed by this Motor/Generator.  For example, this would include the charge used for propulsion in a propulsion motor.";
CM_ SG_ 2566570238 TotalEnergyGenerated "Indicates the total lifetime energy generated by this Motor/Generator.  For example, this would include the energy created during regerative braking in a propulsion motor.";
CM_ SG_ 2566570238 TotalEnergyConsumed "Indicates the total lifetime energy consumed by this Motor/Generator.  For example, this would include the energy used for propulsion in a propulsion motor.";
