CM_ BO_ 2566606334 "Maintenance Information
Used to transmit maintenance information of a machine.";
CM_ SG_ 2566606334 TransOIlFilterLifeRemaining "Signal which indicates an actual life remaining in percent of the transmission oil filter.  0% represents no life remaining in the filter and 100% represents a new filter with full life remaining.";
CM_ SG_ 2566606334 EngOilFilterLifeRemaining "Signal which indicates an actual life remaining in percent of the engine oil filter.  0% represents no life remaining in the filter and 100% represents a new filter with full life remaining.";
CM_ SG_ 2566606334 EngFuelFilterLifeRemaining11742 "Signal which indicates an actual life remaining in percent of the engine suction side fuel filter.  0% represents no life remaining in the filter and 100% represents a new filter with full life remaining.";
CM_ SG_ 2566606334 EngFuelFilterLifeRemaining "Signal which indicates an actual life remaining in percent of the engine fuel filter.  0% represents no life remaining in the filter and 100% represents a new filter with full life remaining.";
CM_ SG_ 2566606334 EngAirFilter4LifeRemaining "Signal which indicates an actual life remaining in percent of the engine air filter #4. 0% represents no life remaining in the filter and 100% represents a new filter with full life remaining.";
CM_ SG_ 2566606334 EngAirFilter3LifeRemaining "Signal which indicates an actual life remaining in percent of the engine air filter #3. 0% represents no life remaining in the filter and 100% represents a new filter with full life remaining.";
