CM_ SG_ 2365277950 V "This value is used for converting inverter voltage in percent to units of Volts (RMS or DC).
(Value in Volts) = (Percent Value)/(100%) * (Reference Voltage)
For example, if this parameter has a value of 400 V and the percent value is equal to 75%, ...";
CM_ SG_ 2365277950 Cur "This value is used for converting inverter current in percent to units of Amps (RMS or DC).
(Value in Amps) = (Percent Value)/(100%) * (Reference Current)
For example, if this parameter has a value of 200 A and the percent value is equal to 75%, ...";
CM_ SG_ 2365277950 Counter "The message counter is used to detect situations where the transmitting ECU malfunction repeats the same frame all the time. The receiver of the information may use the counter parameter to detect this situation. The transmitting device will ...";
CM_ SG_ 2365277950 CRC "The CRC is defined as follows:
• Length: 8 bits
• Polynomial: x^8+x^5+x^3+x^2+x+1
• Initial Value: FFh
• Input Data Reflection: Not reflected
• Result Data Reflection: Not reflected
• XOR value: FFh
SAE makes no claim of the functional safety ...";
CM_ BO_ 2365277694 "Motor/Generator 3 Inverter Status 1
