CM_ SG_ 2365277694 DCSideCur "This is the DC side current of the inverter.
Refer to SPN 11853 [Reference Current] to convert % to Amps.
While motoring, the current is defined as positive.  For example, in a hybrid propulsion system, positive current flows from the HVES through ...";
CM_ SG_ 2365277694 Spd "The measured or estimated motor speed.  This refers to the motor rotor output and excludes any gearbox that may be attached to the motor.   

Refer to SPN 11822 [Reference Speed] to convert % to rpm.";
CM_ SG_ 2365277694 Trq "The measured or estimated motor torque.  This refers to the motor rotor output and excludes any gearbox that may be attached to the motor.
