CM_ SG_ 2565966590 UnswitchedSLIV "Continuously supplied SLI power to this instance of the inverter controller.";
CM_ SG_ 2565966590 SwitchedIgntV "Switched Ignition voltage supplied to this instance of the inverter controller.";
CM_ BO_ 2565966334 "Motor/Generator 2 Inverter Limits Active DC Side
The DC side electrical limits the inverter is actually using.  These may differ from the requested limits.";
CM_ SG_ 2565966334 CurMin "The inverter keeps the DC side current above this value.  This limit may be set in response to a Limits Request or determined by the inverter based on operating conditions.
Refer to SPN 10268 [Reference Current] to convert % to Amps.
While ...";
CM_ SG_ 2565966334 CurMax "The inverter keeps the DC side current below this value.  This limit may be set in response to a Limits Request or determined by the inverter based on operating conditions.
Refer to SPN 10268 [Reference Current] to convert % to Amps.
While ...";
CM_ SG_ 2565966334 VMin "The inverter keeps the DC side voltage above this value.  This limit may be set in response to a Limits Request or determined by the inverter based on operating conditions.
Refer to SPN 10269 [Reference Voltage] to convert % to Volts.
While DC ...";
CM_ SG_ 2565966334 VMax "The inverter keeps the DC side voltage below this value.  This limit may be set in response to a Limits Request or determined by the inverter based on operating conditions.
Refer to SPN 10269 [Reference Voltage] to convert % to Volts.
While DC ...";
CM_ SG_ 2565966334 Counter "The message counter is used to detect situations where the transmitting ECU malfunction repeats the same frame all the time. The receiver of the information may use the counter parameter to detect this situation. The transmitting device will ...";
CM_ SG_ 2565966334 CRC "The CRC is defined as follows:
• Length: 8 bits
• Polynomial: x^8+x^5+x^3+x^2+x+1
• Initial Value: FFh
• Input Data Reflection: Not reflected
• Result Data Reflection: Not reflected
• XOR value: FFh
SAE makes no claim of the functional safety ...";
CM_ BO_ 2565966078 "Motor/Generator 2 Inverter Limits Active Mechanical
The Torque and Speed limits the inverter is actually using.  These may differ from the requested limits.";
CM_ SG_ 2565966078 SpdMin "The inverter keeps the motor Speed above this value.  This limit may be set in response to a Limits Request or determined by the inverter based on operating conditions.

Refer to SPN 10237 [Reference Speed] to convert % to rpm.";
CM_ SG_ 2565966078 SpdMax "The inverter keeps the motor speed below this value.  This limit may be set in response to a Limits Request or determined by the inverter based on operating conditions.

Refer to SPN 10237 [Reference Speed] to convert % to rpm.";
CM_ SG_ 2565966078 TrqMin "The inverter keeps the motor torque above this value.  This limit may be set in response to a Limits Request or determined by the inverter based on operating conditions.

Refer to SPN 10236 [Reference Torque] to convert % to Nm.";
CM_ SG_ 2565966078 TrqMax "The inverter keeps the motor torque below this value.  This limit may be set in response to a Limits Request or determined by the inverter based on operating conditions.

Refer to SPN 10236 [Reference Torque] to convert % to Nm.";
