CM_ BO_ 2364622078 "Stationary Inverter to Bus Sync Check Status
Contains parameters allowing a stationary inverter to sync to another bus.
These parameters are intended for stationary Generator/Engine components, not mobile applications.  See \"Motor/Generator\" PGs ...";
CM_ SG_ 2364622078 ACPhaseDiff "The phase difference between the stationary inverter and the bus voltage.  

For stationary non-vehicular applications of inverters.";
CM_ SG_ 2364622078 InSync "Indicator of whether the stationary inverter and the bus are properly synchronized for paralleling.  This indicator will be based on parameters such as Voltage Match, Frequency Match, and Phase Match.
For stationary non-vehicular applications of ...";
CM_ SG_ 2364622078 VMatch "Indicator of whether the voltage difference the stationary inverter and the bus is adequate for paralleling.
For stationary non-vehicular applications of inverters.
00b = Voltages do not match
01b = Voltages match
10b = Error
11b = Not ...";
CM_ SG_ 2364622078 FreqMatch "Indicator of whether the frequency difference between the stationary inverter and the bus is adequate for paralleling.
For stationary non-vehicular applications of inverters.
00b = Frequencies do not match
01b = Frequencies match
10b = Error
 ...";
CM_ SG_ 2364622078 PhaseMatch "Indicator of whether phase difference between the stationary inverter and the bus is adequate for paralleling.
For stationary non-vehicular applications of inverters.
00b = Phases do not match
01b = Phases match
10b = Error
11b = Not Available ...";
CM_ SG_ 2364622078 DeadBus "Indicator of whether the bus is considered dead for closing to the stationary inverter. This indicator will be based on parameters such as bus voltage and dead bus threshold values.
For stationary non-vehicular applications of inverters.
00b = Bus ...";
CM_ BO_ 2364621822 "Stationary Inverter Control
Message for the inverter control to change or report the status of the inverter system.
For stationary non-vehicular applications of inverters.
These parameters are intended for stationary Generator/Engine components, ...";
CM_ SG_ 2364621822 AuxShutdownSw "Switch signal which requests that all inverter functions stop.

For stationary non-vehicular applications of inverters.

00b = Off
01b = On
10b = Error
11b = Not available";
CM_ SG_ 2364621822 NotReadyToAutoParallelSt "This parameter indicates whether or not all systems required to operate the inverter and close to the bus are prepared to operate automatically. If systems are not ready to operate in parallel, the status parameter is reflected as the ACTIVE state.
 ...";
