CM_ BO_ 2557017854 "On Board Programming 1
Message announcing the availability or status of an over the air software update. If multiple targets are supported, the message will be repeated for each target. In the case that no software updates are available, one ...";
CM_ SG_ 2557017854 OBPPwrOffSoftUpdateSt "Indicates On Board Programming will occur on the next powerdown event when all interlocks indicate it is permitted.

00b - Software will not be updated at power-off
01b - Software will be updated at power-off
10b - Reserved
11b - Not Available";
CM_ SG_ 2557017854 OBPSoftUpdateDeferRem "Indicates the remaining number of times a software update can be deferred. Value is reset to maximum when the software is updated or when new software is available.";
CM_ SG_ 2557017854 Progress "Amount of programming progress completed in relation to the total expected duration of the programming event.";
CM_ SG_ 2557017854 OBPKeySwReq "Request to turn the key switch to the ignition or run position and/or prevent the ignition bus from turning off during on board programming (OBP).
00b = On board programming device is not requesting key switch on.
01b = On board programming device ...";
CM_ SG_ 2557017854 InterlockTargetNotReady "Indicates whether the target is not ready to accept on board programming (OBP).
00b = Off: Target is not inhibiting on board programming
01b = On: Target has indicated that it is currently unable to accept on board programming
10b = Error
11b = ...";
CM_ SG_ 2557017854 InterlockPwrSupplyInsufficient "Power supply (e.g. SLI battery state of charge) is not sufficient to allow initiation of on board programming (OBP).
00b = Off: Power supply is sufficient to permit on board programming
01b = On: On board programming is inhibited due to ...";
CM_ SG_ 2557017854 InterlockParkBrk "Park brake requirement is not met to allow initiation of on board programming (OBP).

00b = Off: Park brake is permitting on board programming
01b = On: On board programming is inhibited due to park brake
10b = Error
11b = Not available";
CM_ SG_ 2557017854 InterlockKeySwPos "Key switch position requirement is not met to allow initiation of on board programming (OBP).
00b = Off: Key switch position is permitting on board programming
01b = On: On board programming is inhibited due to key switch position
10b = Error
 ...";
CM_ SG_ 2557017854 InterlockEngSpd "Engine speed requirement is not met to allow initiation of on board programming (OBP).

00b = Off: Engine speed is permitting on board programming
01b = On: On board programming is inhibited due to engine speed.
10b = Error
11b = Not available";
CM_ SG_ 2557017854 InterlockOverallStatus "Indicates whether all interlocks for on board programming (OBP) have been satisfied. This parameter should be set to On whever any of the other OBP Interlocks are on. This allows a receiving device to know whether programming is permitted without ...";
CM_ SG_ 2557017854 Status "Status of a software update.
0000b = Software Up to Date: no new software is available
0001b = Available for Installation: updated software is available
0010b = In process/Installing: update has been initiated and progressing
0011b = ...";
CM_ SG_ 2557017854 TargetECUAddress "Source address of target device to be programmed, for which the message parameters apply.

