CM_ BO_ 2633801982 "Multi-fuel Engine Hours
Engine hours parameters for multi-fuel engines";
CM_ SG_ 2633801982 EngTtlHoursOfDieselFuelOperation "Accumulated time of operation of engine when diesel fuel is used.  This parameter should be used only in multi-fuel engines.  See SPN 247 for single fuel engines and for total hours for multi-fuel engines.";
