.";
CM_ SG_ 2566692862 EngExRangeOilFilterDiffPress "Change in engine oil differential pressure measured across the oil filter element. The differential pressure is the measured as the pressure at the filter intake with respect to the pressure at the filter outlet. This differential pressure ...";
CM_ BO_ 2499583742 "Engine Timing Actuator Position
