00b = Off
01b = On
10b = Error
11b = Not Available";
CM_ SG_ 2297441534 GneratorCurrentBoostActiveStatus "Status of generator current boost relay that can boost the generator output current for picking-up material operations. When this relay is \"on\", the generator is generating the maximum current for the material handler machine to pick-up material ...";
