00b = Don't Lift
01b = Lift
10b = Error
11b = Not Available";
CM_ SG_ 2297441534 MagnetReverseCurrent "A reverse current being supplied to the electric magnet to reduce the forward current generated magnet field as quick as possible so that the magnet can release material as fast as possible.";
CM_ SG_ 2297441534 MagnetForwardCurrent "The forward current being supplied by the generator to the electric magnet to create a magnet field to lift material.";
