CM_ SG_ 2566713854 EngExhaustBackPressRegulatorPos "The position of the Exhaust Pressure Regulator (EPR) in bank 1 expressed as a percentage of full travel.  One hundred percent means the regulator is fully closed, providing the maximum restriction to exhaust gas flow from the engine.  Zero percent ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566713854 EngTrbWstgtActtr2OperationStatus "Used to identify the status of Engine Turbocharger Wastegate Actuator 2.
