Note:  This is not a calculation of the physical restriction of the filter. 0% is ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566713598 EngFuelFilterIntakeAbsPress "Absolute pressure of fuel at the intake of the fuel filter (suction side) located between the fuel tank and the fuel supply pump.  See Figures SPN16_A & SPN16_B.";
