CM_ SG_ 2499604478 EngExhstGsRcrcltn1IntakeAbsPress "EGR intake absolute pressure measured before the EGR 1 valve.";
CM_ BO_ 2499608830 "Engine Fluid Level/Pressure 10
Engine related parameters";
