CM_ SG_ 2349137662 ExtlAccelerationDemand "Parameter provided to the brake system from external sources. This is the acceleration which the brake system is expected to realize. It is specified as an absolute acceleration in reference to the road.  Positive values lead to increasing vehicle ...";
