CM_ SG_ 2566848510 DrvrWarningSystemIndicatorStatus "The desired illumination of the Euro VI defined driver warning system indicator for relevant malfunctions and diesel exhaust fluid (reagent) tank low level.  Used for Euro VI implementations.  See Euro VI implementing regulation Annex XIII, Section ...";
