CM_ SG_ 2566803454 ROPEngCtrlActive "State Signal which indicates that the Roll Over Prevention (ROP) has commanded engine control to be active. Within the physical limits, ROP attempts to prevent rolling over of the vehicle. Active means that ROP actually tries to control the engine ...";
