CM_ SG_ 2633937150 TripEngRunningTime "Total time accumulated while the engine speed is greater than zero since the last trip reset.  Note that time with the ignition switch on but engine speed at zero is not included.";
CM_ SG_ 2633937150 TripCruiseTime "Total time accumulated while the engine is in the cruise hold state, excluding time in accelerator override, since the last trip reset.";
CM_ SG_ 2633937150 TripPTOGovernorTime "Total time accumulated while the engine is in the PTO or remote PTO governor hold state since the last trip reset.";
CM_ BO_ 2633938174 "Trip Time Information 1";
