CM_ SG_ 2633938174 TripTimeInTopGear "Total time accumulated when the vehicle has operated in top gear for a calibrated minimum time, since the last trip reset.";
CM_ SG_ 2633938174 TripTimeInVSL "Total time accumulated when the engine has operated on the vehicle speed limiter (VSL) while not in the cruise hold state, since the last trip reset.  The engine torque mode is equal to road speed governor during this operation.";
CM_ BO_ 2633938430 "Trip Shutdown Information";
