CM_ SG_ 2566771454 DataMemoryUsage "The used storage capacity of the data buffer memory internal to an ECU, such as a data logger.";
CM_ SG_ 2566771454 KeepAliveBatteryConsumption "The capacity consumed from the direct battery connection since the key was last turned off.  This value is maintained and does not accumulate while the key switch is on.  The value is reset to 0 when the key switch is turned to the off position.";
