 ...";
CM_ SG_ 2633935358 EngExhstGsOxygnSnsrFlngCrrection "The amount of fueling change required by the system based on the measured exhaust oxygen value compared to the maximum fueling change permitted by the system, expressed as percentages.";
CM_ SG_ 2633935358 EngActualExhaustOxygen "The actual amount of oxygen in the exhaust represented as a percentage by volume with respect to the total volume of exhaust gases leaving the engine.
Note:  A value of FB00h shall be provided when ambient or engine operating conditions do not ...";
