CM_ SG_ 2566810366 EngFuelSupplyPumpIntakeAbsPress "Absolute pressure of fuel at the fuel supply pump intake.  See Figures SPN16_A & SPN16_B.  See SPN 7472 for alternate resolution.";
CM_ SG_ 2566810366 EngOilLevelRemoteReservoir "Ratio of current volume of engine oil in a remote reservoir to the maximum required volume.  If a single switch (on/off) is used, 20% and 100% respectively will be used where 100% means no oil needs to be added and 20% means oil needs to be added ...";
CM_ BO_ 2566767102 "Engine Fluid Level/Pressure 3
