CM_ SG_ 2566844414 EngCoolantPress "Gage pressure of liquid found in engine cooling system.

See SPN 20 for alternate range and resolution.";
CM_ SG_ 2566844414 EngCrankcasePress "First instance of the gage pressure inside engine crankcase.";
