CM_ SG_ 2566735358 InTempPreliminaryFMI "Used to identify the applicable J1939-73 FMI detected in the Three Way Catalyst intake temperature sensor by the manufacturer’s sensor control software in exhaust bank 2.  In the case of multiple failures the most severe is communicated.
A value of ...";
CM_ SG_ 2566735358 DiffPress "Exhaust differential pressure measured between the intake and exhaust of a Three Way Catalyst in exhaust bank 2.

(For a single exhaust bank system, refer to parameters in PGN 64838.)";
