CM_ SG_ 2365428478 TimeRemainingInEngOperatingState "This parameter is used to indicate the time remaining in the current engine operating state, based on the state defined in the SP \"Engine Operating State\" (SPN 3543). For the states in which time remaining is not applicable, use 65535 (FFFFh).";
