CM_ BO_ 2566746622 "Brake actuator stroke status
The Brake Stroke Alert (BSA) message will provide the brake actuator stroke status for up to 20 wheel ends.";
CM_ SG_ 2566746622 TrailerBrakeStrokeAxle5Right "Brake stroke status for right brake actuator on trailer axle 5.

000b = OK (Normal operation)
001b = Non-functioning
010b = Overstroke
011b = Dragging brake
100b = Reserved
101b = Reserved
110b = Sensor error
111b = Not available";
CM_ SG_ 2566746622 TrailerBrakeStrokeAxle5Left "Brake stroke status for left brake actuator on trailer axle 5.

000b = OK (Normal operation)
001b = Non-functioning
010b = Overstroke
011b = Dragging brake
100b = Reserved
101b = Reserved
110b = Sensor error
111b = Not available";
CM_ SG_ 2566746622 TrailerBrakeStrokeAxle4Right "Brake stroke status for right brake actuator on trailer axle 4.

